    "title"             "Knox Relay"
    "description"       "Server-side bridge mod for remote server management. Exports game state, inventory snapshots, player positions and progression, and processes item delivery and money deposit queues via file-based JSON communication."
    "changenote"        "v1.2 — Durability is now reported correctly instead of reading 100% for every item, and restoring an item's condition on delivery works. New: cause of death (fire, infection, another survivor) recorded with hours survived and zombie kills. The mod version is exported in game_state.json so a panel can detect which bridge features a server has."
}
